st reviews and an impressive 9.2 location score, this peaceful retreat delivers generous comfort, tropical greenery, and resort-grade amenities just an 8-minute stroll from Mirissa Beach.\r\n\r\n### Tropical Setting & Outdoor Pool\r\nSet amid vibrant gardens and towering palms away from the busy coastal highway, Aura By Epic Collection is anchored by an expansive, sparkling outdoor swimming pool. Guests can relax on sun loungers along the stone sun terrace, sip fresh king coconuts, and unwind in complete privacy.\r\n\r\n### Rooms & Family Suites\r\nAura By Epic Collection offers spacious, air-conditioned accommodations designed for couples, groups, and families:\r\n- **Spacious Air-Conditioned Rooms:** Featuring king-size comfortable beds, large pillows, private balconies or garden terraces, and modern ensuite bathrooms with fresh hot showers.\r\n- **Thoughtful Amenities:** Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, writing desk, tea and coffee maker, electric kettle, and daily housekeeping.\r\n- **Family Configurations:** Deluxe Triple and Quadruple Family Rooms accommodating small groups and travelers seeking ample living space.\r\n\r\n### On-Site Dining & Homemade Sri Lankan Breakfast\r\n- **Abundant Breakfast:** Guests rave about the authentic Sri Lankan curries, fresh tropical fruit platters, eggs prepared to order, and rich Ceylon tea served daily on the open dining terrace.\r\n- **International Restaurant:** The on-site restaurant serves an array of international dishes, fresh seafood, and Asian specialties with halal and vegetarian selections available.\r\n\r\n### Prime Central Mirissa Location\r\n- **Mirissa Beach:** A gentle 8-minute walk to the golden crescent for swimming, surfing, and sunset dining.\r\n- **Shops & Cafes:** Just 3 minutes walk to Yatipila Junction and the main coastal road for boutique cafes, yoga studios, and surf shops.\r\n- **Parrot Rock & Coconut Tree Hill:** 15 minutes walk or a quick 3-minute tuk-tuk ride along the coast.\r\n- **Mirissa Fisheries Harbour:** 5 minutes by tuk-tuk for morning Blue Whale watching excursions.\r\n\r\n### Key Amenities & Highlights\r\n- Large outdoor swimming pool and sun terrace\r\n- Free high-speed Wi-Fi throughout the property\r\n- Air conditioning in all guestrooms\r\n- On-site restaurant with halal and vegetarian options\r\n- Private balconies and garden view terraces\r\n- Free private on-site parking\r\n- 24-hour guest assistance and tour desk (whale watching, safari, and airport transfers)\r\n\r\n*Note: MirissaStays provides verified local destination guides for travelers visiting southern Sri Lanka. You can check live rates, room availability, and reserve directly via Booking.com using the link provided.*',41.00,'USD',4.8,592,'https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/802403478.jpg?k=ce16769bb309b53853ffc34b0257ef9e8281ef3443423577d65b89836420dedd&o=','[\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/802403478.jpg?k=ce16769bb309b53853ffc34b0257ef9e8281ef3443423577d65b89836420dedd&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/683039821.jpg?k=2d76cd190be03cccf0d9a1177363eac1e7f6fae7fff1de7718e2a8953d27a918&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/683035725.jpg?k=aec33901ddc2c0909631e4cbc0b3f5af25654cc24d022d91552c72c8588193ce&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/683961626.jpg?k=eac45a493051e3f820edaa05bbaf911ab537b647290a534c40f5290a8bbd1f32&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/803092760.jpg?k=72219042040f8c01667e461b5045dfbb38f0e7a51feb87411d923c8dbf8c6eac&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/178162831.jpg?k=6078bd1ce320b4eb30fb148d727ba645320bcb914bb8fe26cb69202729336d99&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/683042775.jpg?k=c9798f0b7360c0e05838264060adb49939457f6f6b9ab08f4a2fa1af28aabd75&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/178160632.jpg?k=c957dea44d686bf9cde05d59d2542ce07bc6fe8825c1daac29d63463c8e58f68&o=\"]','[\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Air Conditioning\",\"Breakfast Included\",\"Free Parking\"]','Yatipila Road, 81740 Mirissa, Sri Lanka',5.94839896,80.45870880,'<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3968.335749103054!2d80.45610907452466!3d5.948387594036137!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3ae13f3e8688be53%3A0xf7608daf3dfbe9f8!2sAura%20By%20Epic%20Collection!5e0!3m2!1sen!2slk!4v1789923869292!5m2!1sen!2slk\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe>','https://www.booking.com/hotel/lk/ashiyana.html?aid=356980','+94754361265',0,'published',1,'2026-09-20 17:00:00'),(14,1,3,1,'Mimoza Mirissa','mimoza-mirissa','Discover Mimoza Mirissa in Mirissa, Sri Lanka. Boutique bed & breakfast with rooftop swimming pool, sun terrace, AC rooms, 9.4★ reviews & 5-min walk to Mirissa Beach.','A peaceful boutique bed & breakfast near Mirissa Beach featuring a rooftop swimming pool, palm canopy views, sun terrace, and exceptional freshly-made daily breakfasts.','Mimoza Mirissa is a peaceful, top-rated boutique bed and breakfast located in Godalla PitaWatta, just a 5-minute stroll from the golden shores of Mirissa Beach. With an exceptional 9.4/10 \"Superb\" rating across more than 1,130 verified traveler reviews, Mimoza Mirissa blends modern comforts with authentic Sri Lankan warmth and hospitality.\r\n\r\n### Rooftop Swimming Pool & Palm Canopy Sun Terrace\r\nThe centerpiece of Mimoza Mirissa is its sparkling rooftop swimming pool. Elevated above the surrounding tropical gardens, the rooftop provides panoramic views across Mirissa’s coconut palm canopy:\r\n- **Rooftop Pool & Sun Terrace:** Unwind on sun loungers, enjoy morning swims under the Sri Lankan sun, or cool off after a day of surfing and beach exploration.\r\n- **Lush Tropical Garden:** Ground-level gardens offering quiet seating areas surrounded by flowering plants, birds, and island breezes.\r\n\r\n### Rooms & Family Accommodations\r\nDesigned for relaxation, privacy, and restful nights:\r\n- **Air-Conditioned Comfort:** Clean, modern rooms featuring whisper-quiet air conditioning and ceiling fans.\r\n- **Private Balconies & Terraces:** Wake up to refreshing garden vistas and peaceful greenery from your private terrace.\r\n- **Thoughtful In-Room Amenities:** In-room tea and coffee making facilities, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, private ensuite bathrooms with hot water showers, and daily housekeeping.\r\n- **Family-Friendly:** Spacious room configurations accommodating couples, small families, and independent travelers.\r\n\r\n### Exceptional Fresh Daily Breakfast\r\nGuests consistently rate the breakfast as one of the highlights of their stay in Sri Lanka:\r\n- **Diverse Selections:** Enjoy authentic Sri Lankan curries, coconut sambol, and hoppers alongside fluffy pancakes, eggs cooked to preference, tropical fruit platters, and fresh juices.\r\n- **Vegetarian & Asian Options:** Daily rotating breakfast choices prepared with fresh local ingredients.\r\n\r\n### Prime Central Mirissa Location\r\n- **Mirissa Beach:** Only a 5-minute walk (approx. 400m) to the main beach for swimming, vibrant beachside dining, and nightlife.\r\n- **Coconut Tree Hill & Parrot Rock:** 15 minutes walk or a quick 3-minute tuk-tuk ride along the coast.\r\n- **Mirissa Fisheries Harbour:** 5 minutes by vehicle for early morning Blue Whale and dolphin watching safaris.\r\n- **Weligama Bay:** 8 minutes drive for premier beginner and intermediate surf breaks.\r\n\r\n### Key Amenities & Highlights\r\n- Rooftop swimming pool with sun loungers\r\n- Free high-speed Wi-Fi throughout all rooms and public areas\r\n- Air conditioning in all accommodations\r\n- Exceptional daily breakfast included\r\n- Private balconies with tropical garden views\r\n- In-room tea and coffee makers\r\n- Free on-site parking & bicycle parking\r\n- Public bath & open-air lounge areas\r\n- Airport shuttle service and tour assistance available\r\n\r\n*Note: MirissaStays provides verified local destination guides for travelers visiting southern Sri Lanka. Check live rates, room availability, and reserve directly on Booking.com using the link provided.*',38.00,'USD',4.9,1131,'https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/400858548.jpg?k=4dba23229476dc05f9dbc742a954704207ddb81179d1320eebe6c607dd58a35b&o=','[\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/400858548.jpg?k=4dba23229476dc05f9dbc742a954704207ddb81179d1320eebe6c607dd58a35b&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/400861957.jpg?k=6609e8d08c7380a5b29ee86a7d5e100c7f1526363056e947fc27fd9ab5776314&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/400892597.jpg?k=03cab6f667f9fa46a06dbcdceae67baac8049892ae0eeb6954f497d6344a3607&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/400906581.jpg?k=5a2a30276c23bc908e8b354ac6fb00a4ddea0bd8eac21ebf443478e919b34fff&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/401954610.jpg?k=68049c22316f3b90f1b8ab11650ae7f2508d9e7b576a603272b4c77ecaafbc00&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/400906554.jpg?k=62123560b7b46efbe81e0b1200115280ec4b28aed057cbc37367e5bc3a1ae82f&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/401834721.jpg?k=ae38d9ecc6e3c9d70fdeb832e07f0f32ebfc9157f5e91b963fc4f2c7f2e85b2b&o=\",\"https:\\/\\/cf.bstatic.com\\/xdata\\/images\\/hotel\\/max1024x768\\/400906583.jpg?k=4c642ddffa0418b3bd9be550fa984c65101f16bbc37b69329d2487f03408443a&o=\"]','[\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Air Conditioning\",\"Breakfast Included\",\"Free Parking\"]','Godalla PitaWatta, 81740 Mirissa, Sri Lanka',5.94626384,80.45221703,'<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3968.3512574577053!2d80.44967687452463!3d5.946238194038284!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3ae115449edf1169%3A0xe30c92ce5af44529!2sMimoza%20Mirissa!5e0!3m2!1sen!2slk!4v1789924207072!5m2!1sen!2slk\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe>','https://www.booking.com/hotel/lk/mimoza-mirissa-mirissa.html?aid=356980','+94771234567',0,'published',1,'2026-09-20 17:08:00'),(15,1,3,1,'Coastline Mirissa Boutique Hotel & Spa','coastline-mirissa-boutique-and-spa','Discover Coastline Mirissa Boutique Hotel & Spa in Mirissa, Sri Lanka. 5-star boutique hotel with rooftop pool, full-service spa, sea view balconies, 9.4★ reviews & beach proximity.','An upscale 5-star boutique hotel and spa near Mirissa Beach featuring a scenic rooftop swimming pool, wellness spa, ocean-view suites, fitness room, and fine dining.','Coastline Mirissa Boutique Hotel and Spa is an exquisite 5-star boutique sanctuary nestled along Egodawatta in Udupila, Mirissa, Sri Lanka. Boasting a remarkable 9.4/10 \"Superb\" rating across more than 748 verified guest reviews and an impressive 9.5 location score for couples, this luxury hotel blends coastal elegance with indulgent wellness amenities just a seven-minute stroll from Mirissa Beach.\r\n\r\n### Rooftop Swimming Pool & Ocean Vistas\r\nThe crown jewel of Coastline Mirissa is its elevated rooftop swimming pool and expansive sun terrace:\r\n- **Rooftop Pool & Sun Terrace:** Unwind on luxury sun loungers while sipping tropical cocktails from the pool bar and taking in breathtaking ocean horizons.\r\n- **Second Lagoon Pool & Tropical Grounds:** A peaceful ground-level pool surrounded by native flora and secluded relaxation spots.\r\n\r\n### Luxury Rooms, Suites & Sea-View Balconies\r\nEach beautifully appointed room and suite is designed to deliver superior privacy and comfort:\r\n- **Ocean & Garden Balconies:** Private balconies with sweeping vistas over the Indian Ocean and lush coastal greenery.\r\n- **Premium Ensuite Bathrooms:** Equipped with walk-in rain showers, deep hot tubs, plush bathrobes, and complimentary designer toiletries.\r\n- **In-Room Luxuries:** Soundproofed accommodations, whisper-quiet air conditioning, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen smart TVs, and espresso/tea facilities.\r\n\r\n### Spa, Wellness & Active Living\r\n- **Full-Service Spa & Wellness Centre:** Indulge in rejuvenating Ayurvedic body treatments, aromatherapy, and therapeutic massages.\r\n- **Fitness Centre & Yoga:** Fully equipped fitness room, daily yoga classes, water sports rentals, and complimentary cycling activities.\r\n\r\n### Exceptional Dining & Pool Bar\r\n- **2 On-Site Restaurants:** Serving artisanal breakfast, champagne brunches, afternoon high tea, and candlelit seafood dinners combining Sri Lankan flavors with international gourmet cuisine.\r\n- **Rooftop & Poolside Bar:** Handcrafted tropical cocktails, fine wines, and fresh cold-pressed juices.\r\n\r\n### Prime Mirissa Location & Activities\r\n- **Mirissa Beach:** 7-minute walk to the main golden sandy beach for swimming and surfing.\r\n- **Mirissa Fisheries Harbour:** 5-minute drive for world-famous blue whale and dolphin watching safaris.\r\n- **Coconut Tree Hill:** Quick 4-minute tuk-tuk ride along the coast.\r\n\r\n*Note: MirissaStays provides verified local destination guides for travelers visiting southern Sri Lanka. Check live rates, room availability, and reserve directly on Booking.com using the link provided.*',58.00,'USD',4.9,748,'https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/656068331.jpg?k=8b844a7d21e57a633451858a5d7d47a4d03adfedb4f8cc4955da1849af6cf419&o=','[\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/656068331.jpg?k=8b844a7d21e57a633451858a5d7d47a4d03adfedb4f8cc4955da1849af6cf419&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/656473365.jpg?k=44f49671adc1e1e1be4998e94d1297b8fb5f2615c63a95bf19df99d314e8304f&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/609556897.jpg?k=1fb9ab366f97cec209d549817e00c79f2a10258069da9b118f2572f6d15de11d&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/609559304.jpg?k=eaef9fb0c7affadd31c2f8f9df97fa7387c42e4f5c623640cbe1b5618c4de3e7&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/609560207.jpg?k=da60836666924a5c81eb64f20890dfece0b05071e3ed8ec734bac58bdaf7dfff&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/609559237.jpg?k=10e9d097b0fa5ef8c0762c61175632fb8526f744ee667ffc7553039f002a6c5b&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/609558102.jpg?k=d22f5ffa622633c01631bc4c7a5ab44f3ad181ec686a961e8afc41c2d7b90dee&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/655107567.jpg?k=061279093c98a871eab8c323f416a04d1357c414b98e140fb1f01b4ee983e543&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/609556852.jpg?k=c32f0608052f21607cf1b801ec2d91e5459a89b8383975e1349c147f58eb2039&o=\"]','[\"2 Swimming Pools\",\"Rooftop Pool\",\"Spa and Wellness Centre\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Air Conditioning\",\"Ocean View\",\"Fitness Centre\",\"2 Restaurants\",\"Bar\",\"Breakfast Included\",\"Free Parking\",\"Room Service\",\"Balcony\"]','Egodawatta, Udupila, 81740 Mirissa, Sri Lanka',5.94667219,80.46298134,'https://maps.google.com/maps?q=5.94667219,80.46298134&hl=en&z=16&output=embed','https://www.booking.com/hotel/lk/coastline-mirissa-boutique-and-spa.html?aid=356980','+94771234567',0,'published',1,'2026-09-20 17:40:00'),(16,1,3,1,'The Spice House Mirissa','the-spice-house-mirissa','Discover The Spice House Mirissa, Sri Lanka. Iconic colonial boutique hotel with jungle infinity pool, 4-poster beds, spice garden, 9.3★ reviews & 2-min walk to beach.','A legendary colonial boutique retreat set in lush tropical gardens with a jungle-canopy infinity pool, four-poster beds, and home-cooked Sri Lankan feasts just 2 minutes from the beach.','The Spice House Mirissa is one of the southern coast\'s most revered and beloved boutique havens, tucked along KM 151 Galle Road in Mirissa, Sri Lanka. Rated an outstanding 9.3/10 across more than 606 verified guest reviews, this colonial-style sanctuary is renowned for its lush botanical spice garden, jungle-canopy infinity pool, and the authentic warmth of its host family.\r\n\r\n### Colonial Elegance & Jungle Infinity Pool\r\nSurrounded by flowering frangipanis, lily ponds, pepper vines, and hammocks, The Spice House offers a rare back-to-nature escape just a 2-minute stroll from Mirissa Beach:\r\n- **Jungle-Canopy Infinity Pool:** An iconic pool suspended amid lush rainforest greenery where guests can swim while monkeys and tropical birds pass through the palm trees.\r\n- **Open Veranda & Verdue Views:** A breezy colonial veranda where breakfast and candlelit evening dinners are served overlooking the spice gardens.\r\n\r\n### Rooms & Traditional Wood-Carved Suites\r\nEach room at The Spice House is unique, blending heritage charm with modern comforts:\r\n- **Private Spice Garden & Ocean Balconies:** Open-air balconies designed for peaceful morning reading and sunset birdwatching.\r\n- **Traditional Hand-Carved Furnishings:** Authentic Sri Lankan teak 4-poster king beds with draped mosquito netting, ceiling fans, and classic colonial decor.\r\n- **Modern Ensuite Bathrooms:** Thoughtfully crafted open-air or enclosed bathrooms with fresh hot rain showers and organic amenities.\r\n\r\n### Legendary Home-Cooked Dining\r\n- **Fresh Veranda Breakfast:** Generous morning feasts with tropical fruit platters, eggs prepared to order, fresh juices, and Ceylon teas.\r\n- **Authentic Family Dinner Feasts:** World-famous communal curries made with spices harvested directly from the on-site garden.\r\n\r\n### Prime Southern Coast Location\r\n- **Mirissa Beach:** Just a 2-minute walk to the sand for swimming and beachside dining.\r\n- **Coconut Tree Hill:** A scenic 10-minute stroll along the coast.\r\n- **Mirissa Fisheries Harbour:** 5 minutes by tuk-tuk for morning Blue Whale and dolphin watching expeditions.\r\n- **Dondra Lighthouse:** 15 minutes drive to the southernmost point of Sri Lanka.\r\n- **Galle Fort:** 45 minutes scenic coastal drive.\r\n\r\n### Key Amenities & Highlights\r\n- Jungle-view infinity swimming pool\r\n- Free high-speed Wi-Fi throughout all rooms and verandas\r\n- Air conditioning and ceiling fans\r\n- On-site restaurant with authentic home-cooked meals\r\n- Private balconies with spice garden or ocean outlooks\r\n- Free private on-site parking\r\n- Snorkeling and canoeing equipment rental\r\n- Personalized tour desk assistance (whale watching, safari transfers, scooter hire)\r\n\r\n*Note: MirissaStays provides verified local destination guides for travelers visiting southern Sri Lanka. Check live rates, room availability, and reserve directly on Booking.com using the link provided.*',70.00,'USD',4.9,606,'https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/737092245.jpg?k=4c606493ddeefb0d21b879a914cce03cd2e0f12fd0bed219cc3392e76884e803&o=','[\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/737092245.jpg?k=4c606493ddeefb0d21b879a914cce03cd2e0f12fd0bed219cc3392e76884e803&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/278342671.jpg?k=68ef51f95faebc103ee0611522636ac6ca8fd340eddb29fce1bb7eb7eb230356&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/781295860.jpg?k=4132f18c41f93f7dcc18649a37facd6eaea392dfc67682274fee3630e710c709&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/736963635.jpg?k=89efa4b8d246d8331dbc3a2596d3475ec90870c4a27450be78cd62183484c789&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/891629315.jpg?k=6583c8e4800355aeec951aa9eb6758a248ffc2a883691f1b33504826b5de2199&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/860085340.jpg?k=8bd70039b7ca7065d85ec3fa9db812cd520cb83ff547d27feef6ca03ddc4e59d&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/737542187.jpg?k=e90814fc52b42ac1c7f3733baa8f3438c2bda1dee2799b0d530b2eded8ab3903&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/787833568.jpg?k=a22b0a7bfdff714f835aa418543a0bba53de6784fbe75ce19ab0df7b8601cf3d&o=\",\"https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/787833469.jpg?k=f3bdd0a92665a2cf79a0732e407ab60eb32f6ac8df9d07939c21472a0261c563&o=\"]','[\"Outdoor Swimming Pool\",\"Infinity Pool\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Air Conditioning\",\"Restaurant\",\"Spice Garden\",\"Breakfast Included\",\"Free Parking\",\"Balcony\",\"Family Rooms\",\"Airport Shuttle\"]','KM 151, Galle Road, 81740 Mirissa, Sri Lanka',5.94114641,80.46863079,'https://maps.google.com/maps?q=5.94114641,80.46863079&hl=en&z=16&output=embed','https://www.booking.com/hotel/lk/the-spice-house-mirissa.html?aid=356980','+94771234567',0,'published',1,'2026-09-20 17:42:00');
